      "1": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "PIE\nThis node generates a procedural pie with an adjustable radius and angle.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The Sine node runs from 0.8 to 1 and back.\n• This modulates the angle of the Pie node.\n• The Pie node is sent to the Transform node to rotate it.\n• The Shape Render converts the Shape2D to a texture so that we can apply video effects.\n• The Pixelate effect is applied to finish this famous game character."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 236,
          "width": 850,
          "x": 111.203125,
          "y": 262.9921875
        },
